    {
      "type": "LinguisticObject",
      "content": "W.R. Hearst Collection, New York. George F. Harding, Jr. (1868–1939), Chicago, by 1939 [Harding Collection no. 396]; bequeathed to the George F. Harding Museum, Chicago, 1939 [the museum closed in 1964 and the collection was placed in storage in Chicago and New York]; transferred to the Art Institute of Chicago, July 30, 1982 [incoming receipt, RX13605, July 30, 1982; copy in curatorial object file]; accessioned by the Art Institute of Chicago, 1982.",
      "classified_as": [
